{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 tabby cats in every city. Keep your eyes open.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740890/extras/095fe1f3cd1534a95035f4e5907f55e8.avif?t=1766986946\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740890/extras_big/095fe1f3cd1534a95035f4e5907f55e8.avif?t=1766986946 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stray Tekirs</i> is a relaxing hidden object game where you try to find cleverly hidden <strong>tabby cats</strong> in stylized city silhouettes. The scenes are filled with abstract shapes and layered structures \u2014 sometimes just the curve of a tail or the tip of an ear gives them away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Stylized urban silhouettes inspired by real cities<br>\ud83d\udc3e 100 hidden <strong>tabby cats</strong> per map<br>\u23f1\ufe0f Play with a timer or explore freely<br>\ud83c\udfa7 A simple, calm, relaxing \u2014 and sometimes challenging \u2014 experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused \u2014 some of these tabbies are very well hidden.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hagia Sophia Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740890/2a599d6da61a3b25e7d4a19762e2ae83ccdb9a0d.jpg"},{"name":"Quack!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740890/461e0016a0f2bcb6f5907e24aa658df9b45a0d15.jpg"},{"name":"The King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740890/5c23e6b5835f180c9db382639945cad9100d6a05.jpg"},{"name":"Tree Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740890/63426db787daadf6d38ef1596225f5f546f112cc.jpg"},{"name":"Meeeoooowwwv!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740890/0e3c